OL,3,GNEWSAUnion suspends strikes over
OL,4,Auniversity restructure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA union that represents staff at the
OL,7,FUniversity of Nottingham has suspended
OL,8,Fstrike action which was called over a
OL,9,Fcontroversial restructuring plan.
OL,11,FThe University and College Union (UCU)
OL,12,Fpreviously said its members would carry
OL,13,Fout "sustained strike action" from 5
OL,14,FOctober to 11 December over the Future
OL,15,FNottingham programme.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
