OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAUnion suspends strikes over
OL,4,Auniversity restructure
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plan, which was approved last
OL,7,Fmonth, would see an unconfirmed number
OL,8,Fof job losses, the closure of modern
OL,9,Flanguages and music degrees, a
OL,10,Fstreamlining of support services and
OL,11,Fthe ending of traditional one-to-one
OL,12,Fpersonal tutoring.
OL,14,FThe UCU said it had suspended action
OL,15,Ffrom Wednesday, following "an improved
OL,16,Foffer from the university with measures
OL,17,Fto mitigate redundancies".
